## IExtension & Extension (Extensa)

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Extensa.Contracts` / `Cyrena.Extensa.Models`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Extensa.Core`

### IExtension
The interface all extensions must implement.

#### Methods

##### BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder)
Called by the Extensa.Loader to add the extension to the application dependencies.

### Extension (abstract base)
```csharp
public abstract class Extension : IExtension
{
    public virtual void BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder) { }
}
```

### ExtensionInfo Model
```csharp
public class ExtensionInfo
{
    public string Id { get; set; } = default!;
    public string Name { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? Description { get; set; }
    public string? Icon { get; set; }
    public Version Version { get; set; } = Version.Parse("1.0.0");
    public string? EntryAssemblyFile { get; set; }
    public string? ContentRootDirectory { get; set; }
    public Dependency[] Dependencies { get; set; } = [];
    public bool RequireFrameworkBuilder { get; set; } = true;
}
```

### Dependency Model
```csharp
public class Dependency
{
    public string Id { get; set; } = default!;
    public Version MinVersion { get; set; } = default!;
}
```

### Example Extension
```csharp
public class TavilyExtension : Extension
{
    public override void BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.AddTavily();
    }
}
```

### Extension Manifest (extension.json)
```json
{
  "id": "cyrena.tavily",
  "name": "Tavily Web Search",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "entryAssemblyFile": "Cyrena.Tavily.dll",
  "description": "Adds web search functionality...",
  "dependencies": [
    { "id": "cyrena", "minVersion": "0.4.0" }
  ],
  "requireFrameworkBuilder": true
}
```

